  "body": "### What is the issue with the HTML Standard?\n\nToday we held our now weekly triage call (https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/10318) and I will post the meeting notes there in a bit. The next one is scheduled for May 16, 1am PDT. Note that this is 1 week later (per https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/10163) in an Americas+APAC friendly time.\r\n\r\nPeople interested in attending the next call please respond here or reach out privately to me or the spec editors. We will be tagging issues for the next call again using the agenda+ label in all WHATWG repos and we would like to invite anyone that can contribute to said issues to join us.",
